"┌ Sync: a member's key changed ────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│                                                                              │"
"│ ⚠ The keys of carol@example.test changed since this device first saw them.   │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│ This happens when they reset their account — or when someone (the server) is │"
"│ trying to read what you share with them. Until you accept the new key        │"
"│ nothing is granted to them, and vault keys they hand out are not trusted.    │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│ Compare this new safety number with theirs in person or by phone before      │"
"│ accepting:                                                                   │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│     12345  67890  13579  24680                                               │"
"│     11223  34455  66778  89900                                               │"
"│     01234  56789  98765  43210                                               │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│       [ Accept the new key ]  [ Numbers match: accept ]  [ Not now ]         │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│ ←/→ choose · Enter press · Esc back                                          │"
"└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
